ate"><addressbook><name>SUGAYA, YUKIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Stable nootropic compositions. More particularly, stabilized compositions of nootropic drugs which comprise nootropic drugs such as donepezil and organic acids. Particularly preferable examples of the organic acids include tosic acid, methanesulfonic acid, benzoic acid, salicylic acid, tartaric acid, citric acid, etc.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des compositions nootropes stables et plus particulièrement des compositions stabilisées de médicaments nootropes contenant des médicaments nootropes tels que le donépézil et des acides organiques. On peut citer à titre d'exemples particulièrement préférables des acides organiques l'acide tosique, l'acide méthanesulfonique, l'acide benzoïque, l'acide salicylique, l'acide tartarique, l'acide citrique, etc.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>